    {
      "text": "I know in whom I have trusted, 2 Ne. 4:19. I will trust in thee forever, 2 Ne. 4:34. isles … on mine arm shall they trust, 2 Ne. 8:5. God is my salvation; I will trust, 2 Ne. 22:2. Nephi did fortify against them … trusting in the God … of their salvation, Jacob 7:25. salvation might come to him that should put his trust, Mosiah 4:6. rejoice, and put your trust in God, Mosiah 7:19. putteth his trust in him … shall be lifted, Mosiah 23:22. arm of mercy towards them that put their trust in him, Mosiah 29:20. humbled themselves and put their trust in … God, Alma 5:13. Mosiah trusted him unto the Lord, Alma 19:23. shall … trust in God shall be supported, Alma 36:3 (38:5). they do put their trust in God, Alma 57:27. trust in our God who has given us victory, Alma 58:33. know not the God in whom they should trust, Morm. 9:20.",
